1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:10,640
I'll go down with you.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,560
There's a heavy evil aura inside.

3
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,880
Once you feel dizzy or cold,

4
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:14,800
retreat immediately.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,059
Xiaotang lent it to me.

6
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,360
I practiced for two nights.

7
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,840
I can hit the target within ten steps.

8
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,040
At least I won't drag you down.

9
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,080
Stay behind me.

10
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:22,620
Don't touch anything.

11
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:37,080
This is the Pagoda Fiend.

12
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,160
Don't look into its eyes.

13
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,880
It will drag you into a pre-death illusion.

14
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,600
Stand back.

15
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:50,600
I'll do it.

16
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,720
Okay.

17
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:08,450
This is what the deceased experienced before death.

18
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,520
The Pagoda Fiend didn't even take your life.

19
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:04,760
People like you

20
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:06,490
are indeed hard to kill.

21
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,919
Your wounds heal quite fast.

22
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,890
They share the same talisman core rhythm.

23
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:40,600
I won't miss the next arrow.

24
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:42,440
Miss Su,

25
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:44,600
we are also acting on orders.

26
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,120
Please cooperate.

27
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,740
Yang Gathering Array.

28
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,640
Rise.

29
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:55,640
Thanks, Old Zhou.

30
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,300
What about Qinghe's side?

31
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,040
All taken care of.

32
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,970
Attack the back of their necks.

33
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,960
Don't be smug.

34
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,640
I will definitely defeat you next time.

35
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,440
How do you feel now?

36
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,780
Only this part is left.

37
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,160
You said it would be cured immediately.

38
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,420
Is it still a bit short?

39
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,720
This last bit is connected to the Pagoda Fiend in the mirror.

40
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:31,520
It will hurt a bit.

41
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,250
Bear with it.

42
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,680
You call this a bit of pain?

43
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,280
I almost saw my great-grandmother.

44
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:42,760
Shut up.

45
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:43,820
It'll be done soon.

46
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,079
Brother,

47
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:53,960
I really saw my great-grandmother just now.

48
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,480
Say hello for me next time.

49
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,890
You're still laughing.

50
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,560
Wait till I recover,

51
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,820
see how I deal with you.

52
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,080
Who told you to mess with the Yin Talisman?

53
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,360
If I were a few days later,

54
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,320
how would you deal with me?

55
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,040
Ouch!

56
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,100
I won't do it again.

57
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,040
Have mercy, senior brother.

58
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,440
Chen Qinghe broke the Pagoda Fiend.

59
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,240
He also took the Dui Trigram.

60
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,640
And Old Zhou's Yang Gathering Array.

61
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,500
I didn't expect him to make a move.

62
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,440
I didn't tell you to go.

63
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,440
I wanted to do it for the Mo family.

64
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:28,240
For the Mo family?

65
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:30,800
You almost lost all three newly made mechanical beasts.

66
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,040
Do you know how many years it takes

67
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,300
for a set of talisman cores to stabilize?

68
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,040
How is your hand?

69
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:40,040
I won't die.

70
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:43,700
It's not scary that the mechanical beasts were broken.

71
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,560
What's scary is

72
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,800
you didn't even see how he broke them.

73
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,320
Rest well.

74
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:53,120
You're not allowed to go anywhere for a while.

75
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,520
He refuses to cooperate.

76
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,400
Keeping him will only ruin the plan.

77
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,360
The integration of Yin and Yang in Yanshi Arts,

78
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:00,320
our Mo family must achieve it.

79
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,680
He will figure it out.

80
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,640
Xuan Chen's life

81
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,080
is still in my hands.

82
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,210
Carved like the real thing.

83
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,480
Master Sun's signboard.

84
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,640
Hanging peppers in a carpenter's shop

85
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,600
means the craftsmanship is spicy.

86
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,880
Not afraid of being picked on.

87
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,720
Xiaotang.

88
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,040
You brought friends.

89
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,080
That repeating crossbow you had last time,

90
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:23,160
is it smoother after changing the trigger to sandalwood?

91
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,160
Much smoother.

92
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,200
Master Sun.

93
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,360
This is my senior brother Chen Qinghe.

94
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,760
And this is Sister Su Wan.

95
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,340
Master Sun.

96
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:33,360
This shop uses the mountain city Chuandou method.

97
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:33,880
Yes.

98
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,159
A row of holes from top to bottom on the pillar.

99
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:38,360
The crossbeam goes directly through the pillar.

100
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,880
No need for a whole continuous beam.

101
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:41,159
The mountain terrain shakes a lot,

102
00:05:41,159 --> 00:05:43,200
but this kind of frame won't fall apart.

103
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,040
South Chuandou.

104
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,970
North Tailiang.

105
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,760
Each crossbeam bears weight independently.

106
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,680
More stable in the mountains.

107
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,960
Little friend knows the trade.

108
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:49,880
Come in for tea.

109
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:54,960
Did you build this?

110
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,170
Very stable.

111
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,280
Grandpa said there are many bridges in the mountain city.

112
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,720
A bridge that can stand without nails

113
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,040
is considered a good bridge.

114
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,280
Triangle support is the first lesson in mortise and tenon.

115
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,560
She hasn't officially started yet.

116
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,620
Let her play first.

117
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:09,120
Add this one.

118
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:11,240
The load-bearing capacity can double.

119
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,680
This is the Tang family's secret.

120
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,480
I only teach pretty kids.

121
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,080
Thank you, sister.

122
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,080
It's written in 'Yingzao Fashi'.

123
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,720
It's not a Tang family secret.

124
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,680
My surname is Tang.

125
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:25,040
When I use it, it's the Tang family's secret.

126
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,160
Hahaha.

127
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,040
Come.

128
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,080
Don't just stand there.

129
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:28,940
Come drink tea.

130
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,340
Smells so good.

131
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,720
Can Sister Wanwan eat spicy food?

132
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,480
The spiciness of the mountain city

133
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,280
is different from other places.

134
00:06:39,159 --> 00:06:40,000
No problem.

135
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,400
I've traveled far and wide.

136
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:43,000
What kind of spicy food haven't I eaten?

137
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,080
Two bowls normal.

138
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:45,880
One bowl a little bit spicy.

139
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:47,440
Someone can't eat spicy food.

140
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:49,400
Don't let the spice leave you speechless.

141
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:50,659
That was ten years ago.

142
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:51,840
Now I can.

143
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:53,460
I don't believe it.

144
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:56,280
Unless you finish this bowl of noodles without blushing.

145
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:57,960
What if I finish it and don't blush?

146
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:59,600
Noodles are here.

147
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:07,000
Delicious.

148
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,080
Much better than those places in the capital.

149
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:09,880
Indeed.

150
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,000
Eat the small noodles first.

151
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,040
Tomorrow we'll have copper pot.

152
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,400
And hot soup at night.

153
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:17,680
I guarantee Sister Wanwan won't want to leave after eating.

154
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,560
Eat slowly.

155
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,480
No one is fighting you for it.

156
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:22,880
I'm really fine.

157
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:28,280
Eat more meat.

158
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,680
Look how thin you are.

159
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,640
A gust of wind could blow you over.

160
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,080
Don't collapse halfway again.
